      "updated": 1716189600000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "OBSERVABILIDAD & ESCALABILIDAD\n\n• Monitoring (Prometheus/Grafana)     • Load Balancer (Nginx/HAProxy)      • Logging Centralizado (ELK/Loki)\n• APM (New Relic/DataDog)              • Auto-scaling Horizontal               • Rate Limiting & DDoS Protection\n• Health Checks & Alertas               • Database Replication                 • API Gateway (Kong/Tyk)",
