      "text": "INTEGRACIONES & CARACTERÍSTICAS FUTURAS\n\n• Social Login (Google, Facebook, Apple)      • Analytics & BI (Segment, Mixpanel)           • Machine Learning (Recomendaciones de Eventos)\n• Maps API (Google Maps)                      • SMS/WhatsApp Notifications                    • Video Streaming (Webinars/Hybrid Events)\n• CRM Integration (HubSpot)                   • Marketplace (Add-ons, Extensions)            • Blockchain (Tickets, Certificates)",
